{
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaConstrict.CoilBind": "The naga draws close and suddenly wraps herself around you, binding you in place! You can't help but feel strangely aroused by the sensation of her scales rubbing against your body. All you can do is struggle as she begins to squeeze tighter!"
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaPoisonBiteAttack.CobraFangBite": "The naga strikes with the speed of a cobra, sinking her fangs into your flesh! "
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaPoisonBiteAttack.VenomBlurFirst": "The venom's effects are almost instantaneous; your vision begins to blur and it becomes increasingly harder to stand."
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaPoisonBiteAttack.VenomBlurIntensify": "The venom's effects intensify as your vision begins to blur and it becomes increasingly harder to stand."
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaTailWhip.TailSlamHit": "Before you can even think, you feel a sharp pain at your side as the naga's tail slams into you and shoves you into the sands. You pick yourself up, wincing at the pain in your side."
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaTailWhip.TailWhipEvaded": "You see her tail whipping toward you and evade it at the last second. You quickly roll back onto your feet."
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaTailWhip.TailWhipJumpDodge": "You see her tail whipping toward you and jump out of the way at the last second. You quickly roll back onto your feet."
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaTailWhip.TailWhipMisdirected": "Using Raphael's teachings and the movement afforded by your bodysuit, you anticipate and sidestep {0}{1}'s tail-whip."
  "Scenes.Naga.NagaTailWhip.TailWhipWindUp": "The naga tenses and twists herself forcefully. "
  "Scenes.Naga.Name": "naga"
  "Scenes.Naga.React.GripTightensRelax": "The naga's grip on you tightens as you relax into the stimulating pressure."
  "Scenes.Naga.Struggle.GripTightensStruggle": "The naga's grip on you tightens as you struggle to break free from the stimulating pressure."
  "Scenes.Naga.Struggle.WriggleFreeCoils": "You wriggle and squirm violently, tearing yourself out from within the naga's coils."
  "Scenes.Naga.Won.EyesWideLeaves": "[pg]The naga's eyes go wide and she turns to leave, no longer interested in you."
}
